{"seq":2,"slug":"index-structures","title":"索引结构与查询优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/data-storage-retrieval/index-structures","wordCount":1442,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"索引结构与查询优化\">索引结构与查询优化</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>索引是数据库从海量数据中高效定位目标记录的关键机制。一个精心设计的索引可以将查询时间从线性扫描的 O(N) 降低到对数级别的 O(log N) 甚至常数级别的 O(1)。然而索引并非免费午餐——每个索引都会增加写入开销和存储空间占用，工程师必须在查询加速与写入性能之间做出权衡。</p>\n<p>本文从经典 B+ 树索引出发，系统介绍各类索引结构的设计原理、适用场景和性能特征，覆盖从 OLTP 到全文搜索再到向量检索的完整索引知识体系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"b-树索引\">B+ 树索引</h3><p>B+ 树是关系型数据库最普遍的索引实现。与 B-Tree 不同，B+ 树将所有数据存储在叶节点，内部节点仅保存路由键：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"内部节点: [key1 | ptr1 | key2 | ptr2 | ... | keyN | ptrN+1]&#10;叶节点:   [key1:val1 | key2:val2 | ... ] → next_leaf\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>内部节点: [key1 | ptr1 | key2 | ptr2 | ... | keyN | ptrN+1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>叶节点:   [key1:val1 | key2:val2 | ... ] → next_leaf</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>索引类型矩阵：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>适用查询</th>\n<th>空间开销</th>\n<th>写入代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主键索引 (Clustered)</td>\n<td>数据按主键物理排序</td>\n<td>主键查找、范围扫描</td>\n<td>无额外开销</td>\n<td>页分裂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二级索引 (Non-clustered)</td>\n<td>独立 B+ 树指向主键</td>\n<td>非主键条件查询</td>\n<td>额外树空间</td>\n<td>双重写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复合索引</td>\n<td>多列组合的 B+ 树</td>\n<td>多条件组合查询</td>\n<td>列数 × 数据量</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖索引 (Covering)</td>\n<td>包含查询所需全部列</td>\n<td>避免回表</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前缀索引</td>\n<td>仅索引字符串前 N 字符</td>\n<td>模糊前缀匹配</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"复合索引与最左前缀原则\">复合索引与最左前缀原则</h3><p>复合索引按列顺序排序，遵循最左前缀匹配规则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 创建复合索引 (a, b, c)&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_abc ON orders(user_id, status, created_at);&#10;&#10;-- 可以使用索引的查询:&#10;SELECT * FROM orders WHERE user_id = 100;                    -- ✓ 使用 (a)&#10;SELECT * FROM orders WHERE user_id = 100 AND status = &#39;paid&#39;; -- ✓ 使用 (a,b)&#10;SELECT * FROM orders WHERE user_id = 100 AND status = &#39;paid&#39;&#10;  AND created_at &gt; &#39;2026-01-01&#39;;                             -- ✓ 使用 (a,b,c)&#10;&#10;-- 无法使用索引的查询:&#10;SELECT * FROM orders WHERE status = &#39;paid&#39;;                  -- ✗ 跳过了 a&#10;SELECT * FROM orders WHERE created_at &gt; &#39;2026-01-01&#39;;        -- ✗ 跳过了 a,b\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 创建复合索引 (a, b, c)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_abc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders(user_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, created_at);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 可以使用索引的查询:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;                    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ✓ 使用 (a)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'paid'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ✓ 使用 (a,b)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'paid'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-01-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;                             </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ✓ 使用 (a,b,c)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 无法使用索引的查询:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'paid'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;                  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ✗ 跳过了 a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-01-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ✗ 跳过了 a,b</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"哈希索引\">哈希索引</h3><p>哈希索引通过哈希函数将键映射到固定位置，实现 O(1) 的等值查找：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"hash(key) → bucket_id → value&#10;&#10;优点: 等值查询极快&#10;缺点: 不支持范围查询、不支持排序、哈希冲突处理&#10;适用: 内存数据库 (Redis)、等值连接优化\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>hash(key) → bucket_id → value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>优点: 等值查询极快</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>缺点: 不支持范围查询、不支持排序、哈希冲突处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>适用: 内存数据库 (Redis)、等值连接优化</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>主要实现：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Bitcask</strong>（Riak 的存储引擎）：内存中维护哈希表，磁盘追加写</li>\n<li><strong>Memory-optimized tables</strong>（SQL Server In-Memory OLTP）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"倒排索引\">倒排索引</h3><p>倒排索引是全文搜索的基础数据结构，将&quot;词项→文档列表&quot;的映射关系持久化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"词典 (Term Dictionary):&#10;  &quot;distributed&quot; → [doc1, doc5, doc12, doc89]&#10;  &quot;systems&quot;     → [doc1, doc3, doc5, doc12]&#10;  &quot;database&quot;    → [doc2, doc5, doc7, doc12]&#10;&#10;查询 &quot;distributed AND systems&quot;:&#10;  交集 → [doc1, doc5, doc12]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>词典 (Term Dictionary):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"distributed\" → [doc1, doc5, doc12, doc89]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"systems\"     → [doc1, doc3, doc5, doc12]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"database\"    → [doc2, doc5, doc7, doc12]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>查询 \"distributed AND systems\":</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  交集 → [doc1, doc5, doc12]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>倒排索引的组件：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>技术实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Term Dictionary</td>\n<td>词项到 Posting List 的映射</td>\n<td>FST (Finite State Transducer)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Posting List</td>\n<td>包含词项的文档 ID 列表</td>\n<td>压缩整数列表 (VInt, PFor)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Term Frequency</td>\n<td>词项在文档中的出现频率</td>\n<td>TF-IDF 评分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Position</td>\n<td>词项在文档中的位置</td>\n<td>支持短语查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Norm</td>\n<td>文档长度归一化因子</td>\n<td>BM25 评分</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"向量索引-ann-索引\">向量索引（ANN 索引）</h3><p>随着 AI 应用的普及，向量索引成为 2024-2026 年最受关注的索引类型。向量索引解决的是高维空间中近似最近邻（ANN）搜索问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>召回率</th>\n<th>构建时间</th>\n<th>查询延迟</th>\n<th>内存占用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HNSW</td>\n<td>层次化导航小世界图</td>\n<td>高 (&gt;95%)</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IVF-PQ</td>\n<td>倒排索引 + 乘积量化</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ScaNN</td>\n<td>Google 的 AH 量化</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DiskANN</td>\n<td>磁盘友好的图索引</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低(磁盘)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Flat (暴力)</td>\n<td>全量距离计算</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(N)</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;Query Vector&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Entry Point Layer 2&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Greedy Search Layer 1&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;Fine Search Layer 0&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;Top-K Nearest Neighbors&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"Query Vector\"] --&gt; B[\"Entry Point Layer 2\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Greedy Search Layer 1\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"Fine Search Layer 0\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"Top-K Nearest Neighbors\"]</pre><h3 id=\"空间索引\">空间索引</h3><p>用于地理空间数据的高效查询：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>R-Tree</strong>：将空间对象包围在最小边界矩形（MBR）中，构建层次结构</li>\n<li><strong>Geohash</strong>：将二维坐标编码为一维字符串，利用前缀匹配实现空间查询</li>\n<li><strong>S2 Geometry</strong>：Google 开发，将地球表面映射到 Hilbert 曲线上的单元格</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"索引设计方法论\">索引设计方法论</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 步骤 1: 分析查询模式&#10;EXPLAIN ANALYZE SELECT * FROM orders&#10;WHERE user_id = 100 AND status = &#39;paid&#39;&#10;ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT 20;&#10;&#10;-- 步骤 2: 识别选择性&#10;SELECT&#10;  COUNT(DISTINCT user_id) / COUNT(*) AS user_selectivity,&#10;  COUNT(DISTINCT status) / COUNT(*) AS status_selectivity&#10;FROM orders;&#10;-- user_selectivity: 0.85 (高选择性 → 适合放前面)&#10;-- status_selectivity: 0.0001 (低选择性 → 放后面)&#10;&#10;-- 步骤 3: 创建优化索引&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_orders_covering ON orders(user_id, status, created_at DESC)&#10;INCLUDE (order_amount, product_id);  -- 覆盖索引避免回表\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 步骤 1: 分析查询模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">EXPLAIN ANALYZE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'paid'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 步骤 2: 识别选择性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_selectivity,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> status_selectivity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- user_selectivity: 0.85 (高选择性 → 适合放前面)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- status_selectivity: 0.0001 (低选择性 → 放后面)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 步骤 3: 创建优化索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_orders_covering</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders(user_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INCLUDE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_amount, product_id);  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 覆盖索引避免回表</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"索引失效的常见场景\">索引失效的常见场景</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>函数包裹列</td>\n<td><code>WHERE YEAR(created_at) = 2026</code></td>\n<td>使用范围条件替代</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隐式类型转换</td>\n<td><code>WHERE varchar_col = 123</code></td>\n<td>保持类型一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OR 条件</td>\n<td><code>WHERE a=1 OR b=2</code></td>\n<td>拆分为 UNION 或使用位图索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NOT IN / NOT EXISTS</td>\n<td>否定条件无法利用索引</td>\n<td>改写为 LEFT JOIN IS NULL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LIKE &#39;%keyword%&#39;</td>\n<td>前缀通配符</td>\n<td>全文索引或倒排索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小表全表扫描更快</td>\n<td>优化器判断不值得走索引</td>\n<td>无需优化，是正确行为</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"向量索引实战-构建语义搜索\">向量索引实战：构建语义搜索</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;from hnswlib import Index&#10;&#10;# 构建 HNSW 索引&#10;dim = 768  # BERT embedding 维度&#10;num_elements = 1_000_000&#10;&#10;index = Index(space=&#39;cosine&#39;, dim=dim)&#10;index.init_index(&#10;    max_elements=num_elements,&#10;    ef_construction=200,  # 构建精度 (越高越慢但召回率更高)&#10;    M=16                  # 每个节点的最大连接数&#10;)&#10;&#10;# 插入向量&#10;vectors = np.random.randn(num_elements, dim).astype(&#39;float32&#39;)&#10;index.add_items(vectors, ids=np.arange(num_elements))&#10;&#10;# 查询&#10;index.set_ef(50)  # 查询时的搜索范围&#10;query = np.random.randn(1, dim).astype(&#39;float32&#39;)&#10;labels, distances = index.knn_query(query, k=10)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hnswlib </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Index</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 构建 HNSW 索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dim </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 768</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # BERT embedding 维度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">num_elements </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1_000_000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">index </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Index(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">space</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cosine'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dim)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">index.init_index(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    max_elements</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">num_elements,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    ef_construction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 构建精度 (越高越慢但召回率更高)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    M</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                  # 每个节点的最大连接数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 插入向量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">vectors </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.random.randn(num_elements, dim).astype(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'float32'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">index.add_items(vectors, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ids</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">np.arange(num_elements))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">index.set_ef(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查询时的搜索范围</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">query </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.random.randn(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, dim).astype(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'float32'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">labels, distances </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> index.knn_query(query, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"索引数量控制\">索引数量控制</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>OLTP 系统</strong>：每张表 3-5 个索引为宜，过多索引严重影响写入</li>\n<li><strong>OLAP 系统</strong>：可以创建更多索引（含物化视图），写入频率低</li>\n<li><strong>混合负载</strong>：考虑读写分离，从库承载索引密集的读查询</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"索引维护策略\">索引维护策略</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 定期检查索引使用情况 (PostgreSQL)&#10;SELECT&#10;  schemaname, tablename, indexname,&#10;  idx_scan,       -- 索引被使用的次数&#10;  idx_tup_read,   -- 通过索引读取的行数&#10;  pg_size_pretty(pg_relation_size(indexrelid)) AS index_size&#10;FROM pg_stat_user_indexes&#10;ORDER BY idx_scan ASC;  -- 未使用的索引排在前面&#10;&#10;-- 索引膨胀检查&#10;SELECT&#10;  pg_size_pretty(pg_relation_size(indexrelid)) AS size,&#10;  100 * (1 - avg_leaf_density / 90) AS bloat_pct&#10;FROM pgstatindex(&#39;idx_orders_user_id&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 定期检查索引使用情况 (PostgreSQL)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  schemaname, tablename, indexname,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  idx_scan,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 索引被使用的次数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  idx_tup_read,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 通过索引读取的行数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pg_size_pretty(pg_relation_size(indexrelid)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> index_size</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pg_stat_user_indexes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_scan </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ASC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 未使用的索引排在前面</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 索引膨胀检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pg_size_pretty(pg_relation_size(indexrelid)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_leaf_density </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 90</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bloat_pct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pgstatindex(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'idx_orders_user_id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"复合索引列顺序原则\">复合索引列顺序原则</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>等值条件列优先</strong>：精确匹配的列放前面</li>\n<li><strong>高选择性列优先</strong>：唯一值比例高的列靠前</li>\n<li><strong>范围条件列靠后</strong>：范围查询会中断后续列的索引使用</li>\n<li><strong>排序列最后</strong>：与 ORDER BY 一致可避免额外排序</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具/系统</th>\n<th>索引类型</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Elasticsearch</td>\n<td>倒排索引 + BKD Tree</td>\n<td>全文搜索、日志分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Milvus</td>\n<td>HNSW / IVF / DiskANN</td>\n<td>向量数据库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pinecone</td>\n<td>专有 ANN 索引</td>\n<td>托管向量搜索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pgvector</td>\n<td>HNSW / IVFFlat</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL 向量扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PostGIS</td>\n<td>R-Tree (GiST)</td>\n<td>地理空间查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Apache Lucene</td>\n<td>FST + 倒排</td>\n<td>搜索引擎内核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tantivy</td>\n<td>倒排索引</td>\n<td>Rust 生态搜索引擎</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>索引结构的选择应当由查询模式驱动。B+ 树索引适合 OLTP 场景的等值和范围查询；倒排索引是全文搜索的标准方案；向量索引解决了 AI 时代的语义相似性检索需求；空间索引则服务于地理位置应用。</p>\n<p>工程师需要建立&quot;索引成本意识&quot;——每个索引都有写入代价、存储代价和维护代价。最佳的索引策略不是&quot;为所有查询建索引&quot;，而是根据 80/20 法则，为最关键的查询路径建立最少但最有效的索引组合。在 2026 年的实践中，混合索引（如 PostgreSQL 同时使用 B+ 树、GIN、GiST 和 HNSW）已成为复杂应用的标准配置。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"索引结构与查询优化","id":"索引结构与查询优化"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"B+ 树索引","id":"b-树索引"},{"level":3,"text":"复合索引与最左前缀原则","id":"复合索引与最左前缀原则"},{"level":3,"text":"哈希索引","id":"哈希索引"},{"level":3,"text":"倒排索引","id":"倒排索引"},{"level":3,"text":"向量索引（ANN 索引）","id":"向量索引-ann-索引"},{"level":3,"text":"空间索引","id":"空间索引"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"索引设计方法论","id":"索引设计方法论"},{"level":3,"text":"索引失效的常见场景","id":"索引失效的常见场景"},{"level":3,"text":"向量索引实战：构建语义搜索","id":"向量索引实战-构建语义搜索"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"索引数量控制","id":"索引数量控制"},{"level":3,"text":"索引维护策略","id":"索引维护策略"},{"level":3,"text":"复合索引列顺序原则","id":"复合索引列顺序原则"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"存储引擎对比：LSM-Tree 与 B-Tree","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/data-storage-retrieval/storage-engine-comparison"},"next":{"title":"列式存储与 OLAP 优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/data-storage-retrieval/columnar-storage"}}